#: {{syn|en|flight deck|office}}
# The driver's compartment in a [[race car]].{{defdate|from 20th c.}}
# The [[point of view]] of a [[motorcyclist]] of their motorcycle while riding.
# The handle bar, instrument cluster, and rear view mirrors of a [[sportbike]]
#* {{quote-song|en|year=1984|author=[[w:Steve Harris (musician)|Steve Harris]]|artist=w:Iron Maiden|title=[[w:Aces High (song)|Aces High]]|album=w:Powerslave
|text=Jump in the '''cockpit''' and start up the engines / Remove all the wheel blocks, there's no time to waste}}
